<title>NETHERLANDS: AHOLD Q1 97 net profit rises 69 pct.</title>
<headline>AHOLD Q1 97 net profit rises 69 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZAANDAM, Netherlands 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997 (16 weeks)</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.36  vs   1.10</p>
<p>    Net profit before pref div     234.4   vs 138.4</p>
<p>    Net profit after pref div	228.8   vs 138.4</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		 14.0   vs   9.48</p>
<p>Note - Koninklijke Ahold NV was expected by analysts to post a net profit between 227 million and 255 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Operating profit		   476.9   vs 274.0</p>
<p>    Financial charges		  137.9   vs  74.8</p>
<p>    Tax				     95.8   vs  52.0</p>
<p>    Minority interests		   8.8   vs   8.8</p>
<p>    Div on preference shares	   5.6   vs   nil</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
